# Screen recordings and the cuts made from them. They live in a GitHub release,
# not in git: the two published cuts are 30 MB against 7.3 MB of tracked source,
# and a binary that large is in every clone forever. `docs/sfemu-demo.gif` is
# committed on purpose — 1.7 MB, and it is the only moving image a README can
# play, since GitHub strips `<video>` (see scripts/readme-video.md).
/docs/*.mp4
